 "statement": "Let $\\mathcal C$ be a monoidal category and $\\mathcal R$ a monoid object of $\\mathcal C$.\nThe forgetful functor $\\Mod_{\\mathcal R}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathcal C$ of\n[sk-def-sfb-module-objects] is faithful.",
